    "note": "Every id the release engine needs, as data (factory SSOT 8.6). A target is usable for a write only when it is filled AND confirmed. Values marked confirmed were read out of a working CMS tool in this repository (UNICON-TOOLS/HtmlToolLibraryItem - the HTML Tool Item Editor), not guessed.",
