      "tool.enabled": "toolStatus with options active | draft (the editor writes it as a sibling field)",
      "tool.cmsObjectType": "SSOT glossary names tools-applicationstore; the editor never states its own record type, so it stays unconfirmed",
      "library": "PUBLICWEBSITE-REQUEST--publish-widget-with-data.txt: website-html-tool-library-applicationstore with code { html, css, js }",
      "write api": "the editor writes through the CMS relay tool.requestObjects with the operator session; no Node reachable write endpoint is documented yet - see DESKTOP-APPS/Html-Tool-Factory/html-tool-factory/docs/CMS-REQUEST--store-write-api.txt"
    }
